      <description><![CDATA[<p>New theme: Paper Miniature, the city as a tabletop model cut from paper and card.</p>
<p>The map shows more of the ground: street surfaces, streams, rock, wetlands, walls and fences.</p>
<p>Small structures appear too: chimneys, masts, towers, pylons, fountains and playgrounds.</p>]]></description>
